[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]WHAT THE HUB DOES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Feature[/th][th]Effect[/th][/tr][tr][td]Quiet outfits[/td][td]No equip / unequip spam in conversations during scenes, outfit changes and after loading screens[/td][/tr][tr][td]Temperament[/td][td]Reserved, bold or forward per NPC; set with a hotkey[/td][/tr][tr][td]Troubleshooting[/td][td]Writes a report for bug reports; optional debug log[/td][/tr][tr][td]Settings[/td][td]One MCM page for the hub and its shared settings[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/30379]SKSE[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/13048]PapyrusUtil[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/53000]MCM Helper[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/83578]Papyrus MessageBox[/url][/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install with your mod manager and enable the plugin.[/*][*]Add the modules you want, each from its own page.[/*][*]Run the setup when the game reminds you, or press the hotkey with nobody targeted.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Bug? MCM, page Troubleshooting: turn on the debug log, reproduce it, then Write report. Attach SKSE\Plugins\MantellaLivingWorld\report.txt and Mantella's logging.log.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-Hub]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

